{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>San Diego International Airport</strong> (IATA: <strong>SAN</strong>, ICAO: <strong>KSAN</strong>, FAA LID: <strong>SAN</strong>) is the primary international airport serving San Diego and its surrounding metropolitan area, close to the skyscrapers of Downtown San Diego.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">FEATURES:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2013 Realistic modeling with over 50 custom modelled buildings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2013 Detailed ground polygon model.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2013 Taxi signs and 3D taxi lights around the airport that follow the curvature of the line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2013 Runway approach lighting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2013 Beautiful background scenery and city using OSM (open street map).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2013 Realistic radar display.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The airport is  known as the busiest single-runway airport in the US,\u00a0with a difficult landing due to the relatively short landing area,\u00a0steep descent angle over the crest of the Bankers Hill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774470/extras/KSAN7.jpg?t=1748500605\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">KSAN airport has two terminals and 51 gates:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Terminal 1</strong> The historic terminal currently has 14 gates in use</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Terminal 2</strong> has two concourses (East and West), 32 gates</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774470/extras/KSAN8.jpg?t=1748500605\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackgrou